# Cloudflare Pages Routing & Reverse Proxy Configuration
#
# 1. API Reverse Proxy:
# Proxies /api/* requests to your live Render backend web service.
# Replace the URL below with your actual Render service URL (e.g. https://mfmcf-funaab-api.onrender.com/api/:splat).
# The '200' status makes Cloudflare proxy the request seamlessly with NO cross-domain CORS issues.
/api/*  https://mfmcf-funaab-api.onrender.com/api/:splat  200

# 2. SPA Fallback:
# Routes all other pages to index.html for client-side routing (wouter).
/*  /index.html  200
